/**
 * Convert a decimal amount to a smallest-unit string without rounding.
 * @param amount Unsigned plain decimal string, including zero.
 * @param currency Supported uppercase currency code.
 * @returns Canonical smallest-unit string, at most sixteen digits.
 */
